    <head>
        <%@include file="./component/header.jsp" %>
        <title>FAQ | Book Store</title>
    </head>
    <body>
        <%@include file="./component/navbar.jsp" %>
        <div class="container-fluid cover-img">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <h3 class="text-light mt-2 mb-2 cover-img-text">Frequently Asked Question (FAQ)</h3>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <h4 class='mt-3 mb-2'>
                General Questions
            </h4>
            <p class="mb-0"><b>1. What is eBook?</b></p>
            <p>
                eBook is an online bookstore where you can buy and sell both new and pre-owned books. We offer a wide selection of books at affordable prices and provide a simple way for users to sell their books.
            </p>

            <p class="mb-0"><b>2. Do you sell both new and old books?</b></p>
            <p>
                Yes, we offer both brand-new and used books. All used books are carefully inspected to ensure good quality before being listed for sale.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0"><b>3. How can I search for a book?</b></p>
            <p>
                You can browse books by category on our homepage or use the search bar to find books by title, author, or genre.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0"><b>4. What payment options do you offer?</b></p>
            <p>
                We have UPI, Net Banking, Card, Cash on Delivery (COD) as a payment method.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0"><b>5. Is Cash on Delivery (COD) available for all orders?</b></p>
            <p>
                Yes, COD is available for all orders. You can pay when your order is delivered to you.
            </p>
            <h4 class='mt-3 mb-2'>
                Buying Books
            </h4>
            <p class="mb-0"><b>6. How do I place an order?</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Find the book you want to purchase.</li>
                <li>Click on “Add to Cart.”</li>
                <li>Go to your cart and proceed to checkout.</li>
                <li>Enter your shipping details and confirm your order.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mb-0"><b>7. Can I cancel or modify my order after placing it?</b></p>
            <p>
                Currently, orders cannot be modified after being placed. However, you may contact customer support to check if cancellation is possible before the order is processed.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0"><b>8. How long does delivery take?</b></p>
            <p>
                Delivery time depends on your location. Typically, orders are delivered within 3-7 business days.
            </p>
            <h4 class='mt-3 mb-2'>
                Selling Your Books
            </h4>
            <p class="mb-0"><b>9. Can I sell my old books on eBook?</b></p>
            <p>
                Yes! You can sell your old books to us and get up to 50% of the book’s value.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0"><b>10. How do I sell my books?</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Send us your book details, including title, author, and condition.</li>
                <li>Provide your name, phone number, email, and bank details for payment.</li>
                <li>We will evaluate and offer you up to 50% of the book’s value.</li>
                <li>Once approved, ship the book to us, and we’ll process the payment.</li>
            </ul>

            <p class="mb-0"><b>11. What types of books do you accept?</b></p>
            <p>
                We accept most genres, including academic, fiction, non-fiction, and self-help books, as long as they are in good condition.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0"><b>12. Where do I send my books?</b></p>
            <p>
                You can send your books to:
                📍 eBook Store, New Amar Ujala, Meerut, 25005
            </p>
            <h4 class='mt-3 mb-2'>
                Returns and Customer Support
            </h4>
            <p class="mb-0"><b>13. Can I return a book after purchasing?</b></p>
            <p>
                We currently do not accept returns unless the book is damaged upon delivery. Please check the book details carefully before purchasing.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0"><b>14. How can I contact customer support?</b></p>
            <p>
                You can reach us via: <br>
                📞 Phone: 6399718929<br>
                📧 Email: chetandevx@gmail.com<br>
                📍 Address: eBook Store, New Amar Ujala, Meerut, 25005
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0"><b>15. Do you offer international shipping?</b></p>
            <p>
                No, we currently deliver only within India.
            </p>

        </div>

    </body>
